{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55676","headline":"同于秘丞赋瀑泉诗 · 延寿","name":"同于秘丞赋瀑泉诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大禹不知凿，来源亦自成。\n包应怜衆白，声合让孤清。\n远势曾吞海，飞流欲喷鲸。\n灵槎如可泛，天际问归程。\n（二首均录自光绪三十四年刊张美翊纂《奉化县志》卷四。\n前首又见《古今图书集成·山川典》卷一一○。\n）（按：二诗原署「周僧智觉」。\n同书卷三三《方外传》云：「周知觉，名延寿，钱塘王氏子。\n周广顺二年住雪窦，吴越钱氏崇信之。\n着宗镜录一百卷。\n」原注：「康乾志」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}